//! The procedural in-house template generator (WP-06, ADR-006, `[MOD-01]`..`[MOD-07]`).
//!
//! The template is generated by code, so its provenance is this source (`[LIC-02]` (c)).
//!
//! - [`anatomy`]: proportions (with their sources) and anatomical points.
//! - [`cage`]: the control cage, ring operations, Catmull-Clark subdivision and the cage fit.
//! - [`tube`]: frames and slot bookkeeping of ring tubes.
//! - [`body`]: the body ring grid (torso, neck, head) and its assembly.
//! - [`face`]: eye, mouth, nose and ear fills.
//! - [`limbs`]: arms, hands, fingers, legs, feet and toes.
//! - [`genitals`]: the groin attachment loop and both genital variants (ADR-039).
//! - [`parts`]: eyeballs, tear lines, eye occlusion, teeth, gums, tongue, lip-line helper.
//! - [`regions`]: region, chart and tile tables.
//! - [`relief`]: surface anatomy (bony and muscular landmarks under the skin, ADR-039).
//! - [`scan_face`]: the scanned mean face and its shape components `[WP-25]`.
//! - [`finish`]: the cranium and the nose root, after the scanned face.
//! - [`landmarks`]: the named surface points `[MOD-06]`.
//! - [`rig`]: the skeleton and skin weights `[MOD-07]` `[SKIN-01]`.
//! - [`uv`]: UV islands, cuts, conformal flattening and packing `[MOD-04]`.
//! - [`assemble`]: the final mesh with UV seams and the refined region map.
//! - [`build`]: the whole template, LODs included ([`build::template`]).

pub mod anatomy;
pub mod assemble;
pub mod body;
pub mod build;
